          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "shot-design"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Lead with a continuity note, then a compact shot table. Explain why each shot exists and how it connects to neighboring shots. Do not write H3 prompts unless asked."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "h3-prompt"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "Output the copy-ready H3 prompt first. Follow with a concise production note listing mode, checkpoint, duration, reference roles, and high-risk variables."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "continuity-audit"
            }
          ]
